\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. O Jesus, King most wonderful!
\par Thou Conqueror renowed;
\par Thou Sweetness most ineffable,
\par In whom all joys are found.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2
\par \cf0\ulnone\b0 2. When once Thou visitest the heart,
\par Then truth begins to shine,
\par Then earthly vanities depart,
\par Then kindles love divine.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. O Jesus, Light of all below!
\par Thou Fount of living fire,
\par Surpassing all the joys we know,
\par And all we can desire:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Jesus, may all confess Thy name,
\par Thy wondrous love adore;
\par And, seeking Thee, themselves inflame
\par To seek Thee more and more.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Thee may our tongues for ever bless,
\par Thee may we love alone,
\par And ever in our lives express
\par The image of Thine own.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Abide with us, and let Thy light
\par Shine, Lord, on every heart;
\par Dispel the darkness of our night,
\par And joy to all impart.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7. Jesus, our Love and Joy, to Thee,
\par The Father's holy Son,
\par All might, and praise, and glory be,
\par While endless ages run.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

